OL,3,GNEWSALarge wasp spider species arrives
OL,4,Ain West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's largest spider species
OL,7,Fhas been spotted in the West Midlands
OL,8,Fas warmer temperatures push it more
OL,9,Fthan 100 miles from its usual habitat.
OL,11,FThe wasp spider, known for its
OL,12,Fdistinctive yellow, black and white
OL,13,Fstripes, is traditionally found in
OL,14,Fsouthern England but has been recorded
OL,15,Fincreasingly further north in recent
OL,16,Fyears
OL,18,FUnlike its namesake, the species cannot
OL,19,Ffly, but spiderlings can travel long
OL,20,Fdistances by "ballooning" on silk
OL,21,Fstrands carried by the wind.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
