OL,3,GNEWSALarge wasp spider species arrives
OL,4,Ain West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe spider has recently been recorded
OL,7,Fin Worcestershire, alongside sightings
OL,8,Fin Herefordshire and Warwickshire,
OL,9,Faccording to Worcestershire Wildlife
OL,10,FTrust.
